// Title: Reg Mod Wdigest
// Description: Hunts for reg mod wdigest
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1003.001, T1112
// Severity: low
// FalsePositives:
//   - Software install/update yang sah memodifikasi registry.
RegistryEvents | where RegistryKey contains 'WDigest' and RegistryValueName == 'UseLogonCredential'
